{"kind": "mod", "id": 2006, "name": "Animator Updater", "slug": "animator-updater", "teaser": "Updates weapon animator on Mag Insert", "owner_name": "Choccy Milk", "downloads": 4990, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 4.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:02:08.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-02-08T20:39:16.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-02-08T20:39:16.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Have you noticed that the AA-12 magazine is sometimes animated? Well, it is animated. However, because of BSG wisdom they forgot that attachment with animation won’t get updated if they’re not a Belt Magazine. With this BepinEx mod, the issue of mags not being animated (even though they are animated) is fixed so you can enjoy that rotating cylinder on a gun that no one use. <em>Or you are planning to have transparent mag with functioning spring</em></p>\n<p>Special thanks to CWX for helping me out, this is the only time where I managed to complete a client mod project.</p>\n<p><strong>Before:</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/YQwW4Df.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/YQwW4Df.gif\" alt=\"YQwW4Df.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>After:</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/hwKyz5x.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/hwKyz5x.gif\" alt=\"hwKyz5x.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instruction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n<p><em>P.S Why did BSG not do this, I am astonished, amazed and questioning</em></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1030, "published_at": "2025-03-16T21:13:46.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2006/animator-updater/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2293, "published_at": "2025-04-09T11:08:22.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2006/animator-updater/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["Choccymiruku/AnimatorUpdater"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/Choccymiruku/AnimatorUpdater/tree/main", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}